---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Living in MBR City"
  description="What Mohammed Bin Rashid City actually is — the district behind the developer names, its major communities, and how they fit together."
>
  <section class="container hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Living here</p>
    <h1>MBR City, the district behind the names</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Mohammed Bin Rashid City is one of Dubai's largest master-planned
      districts — tens of square kilometres south of Downtown and east of
      Al Khail Road, built out community by community rather than as one
      single project. Most people encounter it through a specific
      development's name — District One, Meydan, Sobha Hartland, Azizi
      Riviera — without necessarily clocking that they all sit inside the
      same district and share its infrastructure, schools, and road network.
      This site is the layer above those individual developments: what MBR
      City actually is, and how its communities relate to each other.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>The communities, briefly</h2>
    <p>
      MBR City isn't one master developer's single-phase project — it's a
      district hosting several distinct communities, each with its own
      character:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>District One</strong> — villas and mansions wrapped around the Crystal Lagoon, MBR City's best-known amenity.</li>
      <li><strong>Meydan</strong> — anchored by Meydan Racecourse, home of the Dubai World Cup, with a mix of villas and mid-rise residential.</li>
      <li><strong>Sobha Hartland</strong> — a denser, more central pocket bordering Ras Al Khor, close to Business Bay.</li>
      <li><strong>Azizi Riviera</strong> — the canal-front apartment development covered in full on its <a href="https://riviera.dst.llc">own dedicated site</a>, which goes deep on day-to-day life there in a way this page deliberately doesn't repeat.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Each has different pricing, unit types, and daily rhythm — treating
      "MBR City" as one uniform product is the mistake this page exists to
      correct.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>Start here</h2>
    <div class="link-grid">
      <a class="card link-card" href="/coffee/">
        <h3>Coffee</h3>
        <p>Meydan One's cafe scene versus Riviera's walkable promenade.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card link-card" href="/food/">
        <h3>Food</h3>
        <p>Where the district actually eats — one anchor, one exception, everyone else driving.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card link-card" href="/pools/">
        <h3>Pools</h3>
        <p>Building pools versus District One's Crystal Lagoon — what's actually available where.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card link-card" href="/water/">
        <h3>Water</h3>
        <p>The Crystal Lagoon, the canal, and the honest drive time to an actual beach.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card link-card" href="/money/">
        <h3>Money</h3>
        <p>Nearby crypto exchange options and buying property with crypto.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card link-card" href="/news/">
        <h3>News</h3>
        <p>What's genuinely changing district-wide, not one community's own updates.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card link-card" href="/events/">
        <h3>Events</h3>
        <p>Meydan racing, District One's lagoon events, and what's genuinely district-wide.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <a class="rent-banner" href="/rent/">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Rent</p>
        <h3>Looking to rent somewhere in MBR City?</h3>
        <p>Tell us which community fits and get a shortlist matched to it — District One, Meydan, Sobha Hartland, or Riviera.</p>
      </div>
      <span class="rent-banner-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero { padding-top: var(--space-5); }
  .lede { font-size: var(--step-1); color: var(--ink-muted); max-width: 70ch; }

  .link-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
  }
  .link-card { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: block; }
  .link-card h3 { margin-top: 0; font-size: var(--step-1); color: var(--accent); }
  .link-card p { margin: 0; font-size: var(--step--1); color: var(--ink-muted); }

  .rent-banner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    background: var(--accent-tint);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--space-4);
  }
  .rent-banner h3 { margin: 0 0 0.3em; font-size: var(--step-2); color: var(--accent-ink); }
  .rent-banner p:last-child { margin: 0; color: var(--ink-muted); max-width: 50ch; }
  .rent-banner-arrow {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    color: var(--accent);
    transition: transform 150ms ease-in-out;
  }
  .rent-banner:hover .rent-banner-arrow { transform: translateX(4px); }
</style>
